# Built-in presets are the `#`-prefixed ones, and those are tracked. Everything
# else this directory holds is the user's own: `TopBarController.save_to_file`
# writes a saved preset straight in here under whatever name was typed, and
# `#.json` is the per-machine last-session state, rewritten every run. Neither
# was ever meant to be shared, and both showed up as untracked noise in every
# `git status` on a machine that had been used.
#
# Last match wins, so the order is the rule: ignore the JSON, take the built-ins
# back, then drop the session state again. `#` is escaped because a leading one
# would otherwise start a comment.
*.json
!\#*.json
\#.json
